  "name": "Chocolate Traybake",
  "subtitle": "A simple coffee-enhanced chocolate sheet cake with cocoa frosting",
  "description": "A moist chocolate traybake topped with a smooth cocoa frosting and a choice of sprinkles, chocolate shavings, or nuts.",
